  {
    "name": "ORCID_get_profile",
    "type": "ORCIDTool",
    "description": "Get the complete public ORCID record after format and ISO 7064 checksum validation. Returns the raw person and activities-summary objects plus convenience fields. Legacy works_count/employments_count are explicitly group counts; separate group and summary counts prevent grouped assertions from being mistaken for individual works or employments.",
